coolercpp reproduces the API and the file format of the Python cooler library
and carries code ported from it. docs/PROVENANCE.md names, file by file, what
derives from which project. The notices those projects require are reproduced
there and below.

cooler (https://github.com/open2c/cooler), BSD-3-Clause,
Copyright (c) 2015-2023, Cooler developers. The full licence text is in
docs/PROVENANCE.md. Files ported from cooler are listed in the same document.

The test files under tests/data that come from cooler 0.10.2 carry that
licence as well.

Behaviour reproduced from h5py (BSD-3-Clause), numpy (BSD-3-Clause),
pandas (BSD-3-Clause) and scipy (BSD-3-Clause) is implemented from their
documented or observed semantics; no code of theirs is included.
